ried and responsive to player actions and game context.</p></div><div class="row-strip"><span class="strip" role="img" aria-label="Writing: AI-generated, Live generation: AI-generated" title="Writing: AI-generated, Live generation: AI-generated"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell generated hl" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="tag">Upcoming</span></div></li><li class="row"><a tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/game/touhou-aichatrpg"><img src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5251110/3cc16b0cbcbbfc5449d037e637ebbd18581ebfd0/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1792546166" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="row-title" href="/game/touhou-aichatrpg">touhou AICHATRPG</a><p class="row-meta"><a href="/developer/1-5">1.5次創作</a> · <!-- -->Oct 17, 2026</p><p class="row-sum">Images are pre-generated with AI; the game generates AI chat text and text-to-speech voice live during play, using a locally run model.</p></div><div class="row-strip"><span class="strip" role="img" aria-label="Art: AI-generated, Voice: AI-generated, Writing: AI-generated, Live generation: AI-generated" title="Art: AI-generated, Voice: AI-generated, Writing: AI-generated, Live generation: AI-generated"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><